-n=4; three mutually orthogonal displayed columns, one the unity column.
-Each row is output_label : auxiliary_tag | displayed signs.
+PINNED SEMINORMALIZED HADAMARD-VECTOR COMPLETION
+n=8; column identifiers: 101 001 111 100 000 110
+prescribed output-label signs: 001=+ 111=-
 
-00 : 11 | +++
-01 : 10 | +--
-10 : 01 | ++-
-11 : 00 | +-+
+output : tag | six displayed signs
+010 : 010 | ++--++
+011 : 111 | +--++-
+110 : 110 | -++++-
+000 : 100 | -+-+++
+111 : 000 | +++-+-
+001 : 001 | ----+-
+101 : 011 | --+-++
+100 : 101 | +-++++
 ```
 
-The answer is `[-1, -1, 1, 1]` in output-label order.
+The answer, in increasing output-label order, is
+`[-1, 1, 1, -1, 1, -1, 1, -1]`.
 
