/tmp/tmp.PvTzB0f0ut/src/RND_Sect4_SubSect1.tex:48:We want to calculate the probability of two-randomly selected vectors $v_i, v_j \in V$ orthogonal to each other. Therefore, we also need to estimate the total number of SH vectors in $V$, which is given by the following lemma.
